OL,3,GNEWSAProperty with 'extensive tunnels'
OL,4,Agoes to auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hand-built underground railway and an
OL,7,F"extensive" network of tunnels and
OL,8,Funderground rooms are among the
OL,9,Ffeatures hidden for decades beneath a
OL,10,Fproperty going to auction this month.
OL,12,FThe subterranean network below the site
OL,13,Fon Long Lane in Tilehurst, Berkshire,
OL,14,Fdescends through four levels, reaching
OL,15,Fmore than 15m (49ft) below ground.
OL,17,FIt was created during two decades by
OL,18,Fthe property's previous owner, the late
OL,19,FTony Deane, who was a civil engineer
OL,20,Fwith a passion for tunnelling.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
