OL,3,GNEWSAProperty with 'extensive tunnels'
OL,4,Agoes to auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Worrall, auctioneer and
OL,7,Fconsultant at BTG Eddisons Property
OL,8,FAuctions, said the site "represents a
OL,9,Freally unique opportunity for somebody
OL,10,Fto either develop it or to live there
OL,11,Fand enjoy it".
